.TH DANBY-HOVERCRAFT 1
.SH NAME
danby-hovercraft \- planar translation and yaw of a hovercraft
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/hovercraft
.SH MODEL
Body-directed thrust accelerates the craft against linear drag.  Rudder moment,
rotational inertia, and yaw damping determine heading.  Translation therefore
turns only as the integrated body heading changes.
.SH DISPLAY
The triangular plan view rotates with heading.  Speed and heading are plotted.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/hovercraft.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
